      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1363912820,
      "text": "Anacardium excelsum, the wild cashew, espavél or espavé, is a tree in the flowering plant family Anacardiaceae. The tree is common in the tropical and subtropical dry broadleaf forests of Pacific and Atlantic watersheds of Central and South America, extending as far north as Guatemala and south into Ecuador."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Anacardium excelsum",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anacardium_excelsum",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 168413407,
      "text": "Anacardium excelsum, caracolí, el mijuguo de Venezuela, mijao, \"carnanzuelo\", \"espavé\" o espavel es una especie botánica de árboles americanos de la zona intertropical de la familia de las Anacardiaceae."
    }
